# Only what the images use goes into the build context: Dockerfile.agent copies forgeyard/;
# Dockerfile.server also needs the web UI's sources, the lock file and the user guide.
*
!forgeyard
!web
!docs/guide
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!main.py
!LICENSE
# Built inside the server image (and never part of the agent's): a local build would be stale.
forgeyard/static
web/node_modules
web/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__/
